# TON Cell ABI Viewer

Solid/Vite/TypeScript app for inspecting TON Bag-of-Cells payloads with worker-backed parsing, custom TLB schemas, ABI opcode heuristics and exportable output views.

## Supported inputs

- Base64 / `te6cc...` BOCs
- Hex BOCs with or without `0x`
- Whitespace-wrapped payloads
- Explorer links containing `boc`, `cell`, `payload`, `message`, `state` or related parameters
- Multi-root BOCs with a selectable root index

## Supported views

- Tree view
- YAML
- JSON
- Raw cell tree with bits, refs, hashes, depths, level mask and exotic cell labels
- TVM code disassembly when available

## Built-in examples

The UI ships examples for text comments, jetton transfer, NFT transfer, transaction/block samples and StateInit.

## Parser coverage

- Custom runtime TLB with cache
- Known opcode registry for comments, jettons, NFTs, wallets, highload, multisig, staking, DNS, metadata/content and StateInit heuristics
- `@truecarry/tlb-abi` payload fallback
- Generated `block.tlb.ts` fallback
- Raw cell tree fallback with recursion/depth guards
- Strict and partial parsing modes with provenance/warnings

